# Strict policy: proves the checker strips upgrade-insecure-requests and HSTS for its local server.
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self'; style-src 'self'; img-src 'self' data:; upgrade-insecure-requests
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
